### Phase 1 discarded raw benchmark data (~85MB) ###
# Why-discarded is preserved via README.md in each dir (kept out of ignore);
# the raw per-run JSON/log data itself is not — see each README for the
# canonical doc section that explains the discard. Official 24-run data
# (docs/test-results/phase1/unit6/) and calibration-only data
# (unit6-metric-calibration/) are NOT covered by this rule and stay tracked.
docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-attempt1-discarded/*
!docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-attempt1-discarded/README.md
docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-attempt2-discarded/*
!docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-attempt2-discarded/README.md
docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-A-rerun-old/*
!docs/test-results/phase1/unit6-A-rerun-old/README.md
